OL,3,GNEWSATraders sympathise with Christmas
OL,4,Alights decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraders have expressed sympathy for
OL,7,Ftheir local authority after it
OL,8,Fannounced it would not bring back a
OL,9,Fstandalone Christmas lights switch-on,
OL,10,Fdespite concerns the move could affect
OL,11,Fbusiness.
OL,13,FWorcester City Council said the cost of
OL,14,Fstaging a separate event rose from
OL,15,F#5,389 in 2023 to #15,058 in 2024,
OL,16,Fbefore it was cancelled the following
OL,17,Fyear.
OL,19,FInstead, the city's Christmas lights
OL,20,Fswitch-on will again form part of the
OL,21,Fopening of the Worcester Victorian
OL,22,FChristmas Fayre on 3 December.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
