OL,3,GNEWSATraders sympathise with Christmas
OL,4,Alights decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FGift stallholder Beverley Green said
OL,7,Fthe decision was "understandable" but
OL,8,Fwould mean some small businesses lost a
OL,9,Fvaluable trading opportunity.
